/Pagemaster/ExaltedBook","names":{"en":"Noctua","zh":"夜枭"},"provenance":[[0,32],[1,32]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Summon a mighty bow and unleash a volley of devastating arrows.","zh":"召唤出一把强力长弓并发动毁灭性的集中箭矢射击。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/ExaltedBow","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/ExaltedBow","names":{"en":"Artemis Bow","zh":"月神狩弓"},"provenance":[[0,33],[1,33]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":null,"zh":null},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/PrimeExaltedBow","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Ranger/PrimeExaltedBow","names":{"en":"Artemis Bow Prime","zh":"圣装月神狩弓"},"provenance":[[0,34],[1,34]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Wield the power of the stars in a constant battle for supremacy. The dueling sons, Sirius & Orion, occupy the space of a single Warframe, jockeying for position to rain cosmic destruction upon foes.","zh":"在永无休止的霸权争夺战中，驾驭星辰之力。西里斯与奥里昂这对决斗之子，在同一个战甲中，彼此角力，争相占据有利位置，向敌人倾泻宇宙级的毁灭之力。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/SiriusOrion/OrionSuit","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/SiriusOrion/OrionSuit","names":{"en":"Orion & Sirius","zh":"奥里昂&西里斯"},"provenance":[[0,35],[1,35]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Lizzie was born from Flare’s own Techrot-infested blood. More than a mere instrument, she thrums with fire-spitting fury.","zh":"丽兹诞生于弗莱尔被科腐者感染的血液中。她演奏出的不仅有美妙的音符，还有狂热的怒火。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Temple/ExaltedGuitar","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Temple/ExaltedGuitar","names":{"en":"Lizzie","zh":"丽兹"},"provenance":[[0,36],[1,36]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Seva