ventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardPrimeSuit","names":{"en":"Merulina Prime","zh":"圣装浪漪珊瑚"},"provenance":[[0,41],[1,41]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"Summon Merulina, a rideable creature of the waves, and the inspiration for K-Driving. Merulina protects Yareli by absorbing a large portion of incoming damage.","zh":"召唤浪漪珊瑚，这是一种浪涌中的可骑乘生物，也是 K 式悬浮板的灵感来源。浪漪珊瑚通过吸收大部分来袭的伤害从而保护咏浪之灵。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardSuit","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Powersuits/Yareli/BoardSuit","names":{"en":"Merulina","zh":"浪漪珊瑚"},"provenance":[[0,42],[1,42]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"A titanic blade modeled after some of the very oldest swords, this weapon was designed to slice through massed enemy troops in a single stroke.","zh":"一把灵感源自最古老刀剑的巨大利刃，这把武器是为了一次性击穿大量敌人而设计的。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/AbilitySword/NechroTechSwordWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/AbilitySword/NechroTechSwordWeapon","names":{"en":"Ironbride","zh":"铁嫁"},"provenance":[[0,43],[1,43]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descriptions":{"en":"The pinnacle of Entrati weapons design: dual energy mortars that fire with such devastating power that the Necramech must first be locked into a braced, stationary turret mode.","zh":"英择谛武器设计的巅峰之作：双能追击炮的毁灭威力之大，使得殁世机甲必须将自身锁定在稳定的炮塔模式下来使用该武器。"},"id":"/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/ExaltedArtilleryWeapon","key":"ClientInventorySpecialItems|/Lotus/StoreItems/Types/Enemies/Orokin/Entrati/EntratiTech/NechroTech/ExaltedArtilleryWeapon","names":{"en":"Arquebex","zh":"钩铳"},"provenance":[[0,44],[1,44]],"section":"ClientInventorySpecialItems","variantSources":{"en":0,"zh":1}},{"descri